# ── 1. WHAT IS GENUIX ───────────────────────────────────────

Genuix is a B2B SaaS platform for small and mid-size jewelry
shops in India. It solves two core problems:

  1. GOLD VERIFICATION — Shop owners or customers upload a
     photo of jewelry. AI (Claude claude-opus-4-8) analyzes the
     image and returns: purity (22K/18K/24K), BIS hallmark
     status, estimated weight, and live MCX-linked valuation.

  2. SHOP MANAGEMENT — A complete operating system for jewelry
     shops: inventory tracking, customer CRM, auto-billing
     (weight × purity × live MCX rate + making charges + GST),
     and WhatsApp notifications to customers.

Target users: Jewelry shop owners in India (Tamil Nadu, 
Maharashtra, Gujarat, Rajasthan) who currently use paper 
registers or basic Tally. They are NOT technical.

Business model: ₹499–₹2999/month SaaS subscription per shop.
First customer: the founder's own jewelry shop (warm intro).

Tagline: "Every karat, verified."
Domain: genuix.ai | genuix.in


# ── 2. TECH STACK ───────────────────────────────────────────

## Frontend
- Framework   : Next.js 14 (App Router — NOT pages router)
- Language    : TypeScript (strict mode, always)
- Styling     : Tailwind CSS v3 (utility classes only, no CSS modules)
- Components  : shadcn/ui (installed via CLI, lives in components/ui/)
- Charts      : Recharts
- Icons       : lucide-react
- HTTP client : fetch (native) wrapped in lib/api.ts
- Auth        : Supabase Auth (via @supabase/supabase-js)
- State       : React hooks + SWR for server state
- Fonts       : Cormorant Garamond (display) + DM Sans (UI) + DM Mono (data)
  — loaded via next/font/google

## Backend
- Framework   : FastAPI (Python 3.11)
- Server      : Uvicorn
- AI          : Anthropic SDK — model is always "claude-opus-4-8"
- Image processing : OpenCV (cv2)
- Database    : Supabase Python client (@supabase/supabase-py)
- Validation  : Pydantic v2
- Env vars    : python-dotenv
- File upload : python-multipart

## Database / Services
- Primary DB  : Supabase (PostgreSQL under the hood)
- Auth        : Supabase Auth
- Storage     : Supabase Storage (for jewelry images)
- Gold rates  : MCX API (free tier) — cached in memory, 5 min TTL
- Notifications: WhatsApp Business API (Phase 2)

## Dev Tools
- IDE         : Cursor (this file)
- OS          : Windows 11 / PowerShell
- Package mgr : npm (frontend), pip (backend)
- Version ctrl: Git + GitHub


# ── 3. BRAND & DESIGN SYSTEM ────────────────────────────────

## Colors — ALWAYS use these exact hex values
  midnight  : #0D1520   ← primary dark background
  gold      : #C4952A   ← brand accent, CTAs, highlights
  gold-light: #E8C06A   ← secondary gold, hover states
  gold-pale : #F5E6C0   ← very light gold tint
  ivory     : #F7F0E4   ← light background (NOT pure white)
  ivory-dark: #EDE0C8   ← borders on light backgrounds
  teal      : #1A7A6E   ← verified/success states ONLY
  graphite  : #2E2E2E   ← body text on light backgrounds
  muted     : #8A8070   ← secondary text, captions

## Tailwind custom colors (extend in tailwind.config.ts)
  midnight, gold, 'gold-light', 'gold-pale',
  ivory, 'ivory-dark', teal, graphite, muted

## Typography
  Display headlines → font-cormorant (Cormorant Garamond, weight 300/400)
  All UI text       → font-sans (DM Sans, weight 300/400/500)
  All data/numbers  → font-mono (DM Mono) — purity grades, weights, rates

## Logo
  - Hexagonal stamp shape (references BIS hallmark certification)
  - Lettermark: "G" in Cormorant Garamond inside the hexagon
  - Small teal dot at the apex — the "verified" signal
  - NEVER remove the teal dot from any logo usage
  - Component lives at: components/shared/Logo.tsx

## Design principles
  - Dark primary UI (midnight background with gold accents)
  - Premium feel — this is a financial/trust product
  - Verified states always use teal (#1A7A6E), never green
  - Error states use standard red
  - Loading skeletons match the midnight/gold palette
  - No rounded-full buttons — use rounded-md or rounded-lg
  - Borders: border-ivory-dark on light, border-white/10 on dark


